#. type: Title #
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "021 — Changelog and upgrade"
msgstr "021 — Changelog e upgrade"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "For all released packages, we've a detailed changelog and upgrade guide."
msgstr "Para todos os pacotes lançados, mantemos um changelog detalhado e um guia de upgrade."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Changelog"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "Changelog is written for each version released. The file name is `CHANGELOG.md`. The format is the following:"
msgstr "O changelog é escrito para cada versão lançada. O nome do arquivo é `CHANGELOG.md`. O formato é o seguinte:"

#. type: Fenced code block (markdown)
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# My package Change Log\n"
"\n"
"## 1.0.2 under development\n"
"\n"
"- no changes in this release.\n"
"\n"
"## 1.0.1 March 23, 2021\n"
"\n"
"- Bug #42: Short description of the change (@author1, @author2)\n"
"\n"
"## 1.0.0 February 02, 2021\n"
"\n"
"- Initial release.\n"
msgstr ""
"# My package Change Log\n"
"\n"
"## 1.0.2 under development\n"
"\n"
"- no changes in this release.\n"
"\n"
"## 1.0.1 March 23, 2021\n"
"\n"
"- Bug #42: Short description of the change (@author1, @author2)\n"
"\n"
"## 1.0.0 February 02, 2021\n"
"\n"
"- Initial release.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "There \"My package\" is the name of the package, `1.0.1` is the version released followed by release date.  For each version, there are a number of lines listing the changes.  \"Bug\" refers to a change type.  The following types are used:"
msgstr "Ali, \"My package\" é o nome do pacote, `1.0.1` é a versão lançada, seguida da data de release.  Para cada versão, há algumas linhas listando as mudanças.  \"Bug\" indica o tipo da mudança.  São usados os seguintes tipos:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "New — New features."
msgstr "New — Novas funcionalidades."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "Chg — General changes."
msgstr "Chg — Mudanças gerais."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "Enh — Existing feature enhancements."
msgstr "Enh — Melhorias em funcionalidades existentes."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "Bug — Bug fixes."
msgstr "Bug — Correções de bugs."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "In the changelog file lines should be ordered as New, Chg, Enh, Bug."
msgstr "No arquivo de changelog, as linhas devem ser ordenadas como New, Chg, Enh, Bug."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "\"#42\" above is the number of issue or pull requests corresponding to the change. \"author1\" is the GitHub nickname of the code author. \"author2\" is an additional author. An author's nickname MUST be prefixed with `@`."
msgstr "\"#42\" acima é o número da issue ou do pull request correspondente à mudança. \"author1\" é o nickname no GitHub do autor do código. \"author2\" é um autor adicional. O nickname de um autor DEVE ter o prefixo `@`."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Upgrade"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "Upgrade guide is created when there is a new major version that isn't compatible with the previous one.  It describes steps necessary to upgrade application code."
msgstr "O guia de upgrade é criado quando há uma nova versão major que não é compatível com a anterior.  Ele descreve os passos necessários para fazer o upgrade do código da aplicação."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
msgid "The file name is `UPGRADE.md`. The format is the following:"
msgstr "O nome do arquivo é `UPGRADE.md`. O formato é o seguinte:"

#. type: Fenced code block (markdown)
#: ../src/internals/021-changelog-upgrade.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Upgrading Instructions for my package\n"
"\n"
"This file contains the upgrade notes. These notes highlight changes that could break your\n"
"application when you upgrade the package from one version to another.\n"
"\n"
"> **Important!** The following upgrading instructions are cumulative. That is, if you want\n"
"> to upgrade from version A to version C and there is version B between A and C, you need\n"
"> to follow the instructions for both A and B.\n"
"\n"
"## Upgrade from 2.x\n"
"\n"
"- Public method `test()` was removed. Use `perform()` instead.\n"
"\n"
"## Upgrade from 1.x\n"
"\n"
"- Clean up the cache after upgrading. Old cache is not compatible with new code.\n"
msgstr ""
"# Upgrading Instructions for my package\n"
"\n"
"This file contains the upgrade notes. These notes highlight changes that could break your\n"
"application when you upgrade the package from one version to another.\n"
"\n"
"> **Important!** The following upgrading instructions are cumulative. That is, if you want\n"
"> to upgrade from version A to version C and there is version B between A and C, you need\n"
"> to follow the instructions for both A and B.\n"
"\n"
"## Upgrade from 2.x\n"
"\n"
"- Public method `test()` was removed. Use `perform()` instead.\n"
"\n"
"## Upgrade from 1.x\n"
"\n"
"- Clean up the cache after upgrading. Old cache is not compatible with new code.\n"
